   "step": "原因 / 做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "NavPathStack.getAllPathName() 返回的是当前路由栈中各 NavDestination 页面的名称，不是 pageMap 或路由表里注册过的页面名；尚未入栈的目标页不在其中",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-navigation.md，getAllPathName；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/navigation.d.ts，NavPathStack.getAllPathName",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "NavPathStack.getIndexByName(name) 同样只在当前路由栈里查，返回栈中全部名为 name 的页面的位置索引",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-navigation.md，getIndexByName；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/navigation.d.ts，NavPathStack.getIndexByName",
